<dialog class="vs-settings" id="vs-settings-dialog" aria-labelledby="vs-setting-title"><header><div><small id="vs-setting-eyebrow"></small><h2 id="vs-setting-title">调整设定</h2></div><button type="button" class="close" data-vs-close aria-label="关闭视频设定">×</button></header><form id="vs-setting-form"><div class="dialog-body"><label class="field-label" for="vs-setting-value" id="vs-field-label"></label><select id="vs-setting-value"></select><p class="quiet small" id="vs-field-help"></p><section id="vs-script-preview" hidden aria-labelledby="vs-script-title"><div class="vs-mini-heading"><strong id="vs-script-title"></strong><button type="button" class="text-button" id="vs-script-edit">修改文案</button></div><p id="vs-script-status" class="quiet small" role="status"></p><div id="vs-script-text" class="vs-script-text"></div><p class="quiet small">查看不保存、不生成、不产生费用。</p></section><fieldset id="vs-scope"><legend>应用范围</legend><label><input type="radio" name="vs-scope" value="scene" checked> 仅本段</label><label><input type="radio" name="vs-scope" value="global"> 全片默认 <small>保留分镜的单独设定</small></label></fieldset><button type="button" id="vs-inherit" class="text-button" hidden>恢复沿用全片设定</button><div id="vs-person-actions" hidden><button type="button" class="secondary" id="vs-person-edit">编辑本段人物与导演稿</button><button type="button" class="secondary" id="vs-person-profile">查看全片人物参考</button></div><div class="impact-note" id="vs-impact">仅保存设定，不会生成素材或产生费用；制作前需重新交接与核价。</div><p id="vs-setting-error" class="form-error" role="alert"></p></div><footer><button type="button" class="secondary" data-vs-close>取消</button><button type="submit" class="primary" id="vs-setting-save">保存设定</button></footer></form></dialog>
